{"id":"torrey:censers","source":"torrey","name":"Censers","slug":"censers","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"For burning incense — Le 10:1; 2Ch 26:19.","refs":[["Lev",10,1,10,1],["2Chr",26,19,26,19]]},{"text":"Brass. — Nu 16:39.","refs":[["Num",16,39,16,39]]},{"text":"Gold. — 1Ki 7:50.","refs":[["1Kgs",7,50,7,50]]},{"text":"One of gold in the most holy place — Heb 9:4.","refs":[["Heb",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Directions for removing — Nu 4:14.","refs":[["Num",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"Often used in idolatrous worship — Eze 8:11.","refs":[["Ezek",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"Of Korah, &c made into plates to cover the altar — Nu 16:18,39.","refs":[["Num",16,18,16,18],["Num",16,39,16,39]]},{"text":"Typical of Christ’s intercession — Re 8:3,5.","refs":[["Rev",8,3,8,3],["Rev",8,5,8,5]]}],"refCount":11}
